#
# File: 010-traceroute-icmp-reply-out-req-accept.rule
# Title: Allow local traceroute send ICMP back to remote traceroute initiator


# Outbound ICMP Time Exceeded response to inbound traceroute
# Called by: zones/red/ip-filter-output-red-icmp.chain
icmp type time-exceeded accept comment "local-to-remote inbound traceroute iCMP exceeded response"

# Outbound ICMP Destination Unreachable response to inbound traceroute
icmp type destination-unreachable accept comment "local-to-remote inbound traceroute ICMP unreachable"